<br />
<statline Name="Duration" DisplayName="Duration" />
<statline Name="Cooldown" DisplayName="冷卻時間" /></description>
  </ability>
  <ability Command="CommandLase">
    <description><p>你將周圍的光線聚焦成一道雷射光束。</p>
<p>暫時減少 1 單位你的環境光半徑。</p>
<br />
<statline Name="LaserDamageInc" DisplayName="雷射傷害增量" />
<statline Name="LaserPen" DisplayName="雷射穿透" /></description>
  </ability>
  <ability Command="CommandAmbientLight">
    <description><p>你在 <stat Name="Radius" /> 的半徑範圍內產生環境光。</p>
